^deployment/echo created$
^config/greeting created$
^deployment/front created$
^echo-[12]: hi$
^SERVICE +READY +USERS +WAITING +CONNECTIONS$
^echo +2/2 +1 +0 +[0-9]+$
^\[front-1\] worker: MESSAGE=hello v1$
^\[front-1\] worker: /etc/message\.txt: greeting v1 \(a file from the Config\)$
^\[front-1\] worker: echo said: echo-[12]: hello from front-1$
^config/greeting configured$
^deployment/front rolling out revision 2$
^deployment/front revision 2: complete \(1/1 ready\)$
^front-2 +1/1 +Running +0 +2 +[0-9]+s +[a-z0-9-]+$
^\[front-2\] worker: MESSAGE=hello v2$
^1 +kube-front:r1$
^2 +kube-front:r2$
^deployment/front rolling back: revision 3 = revision 1$
^deployment/stuck created$
^  [0-9]+s +Liveness probe failed: stuck-1 did not answer for 7s$
^  [0-9]+s +Restarted pod stuck-1 \(1\)$
^deployment/echo deleted$
^config/greeting deleted$
